{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17563","headline":"奉陪段相公晚夏登张仪楼 · 姚向","name":"奉陪段相公晚夏登张仪楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦相架羣材，登临契上台。\n查从银汉落，江自雪山来。\n俪曲亲流火，凌风洽小杯。\n帝乡如在目，欲下尽裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}